{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒師下佛前跪，唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：無。下去例此答。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能持。三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能持。下\n皆例此答。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今用南山鈔優婆塞戒經為本，及傍引遺教，此驟錄備急，未可全依。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云\n云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或有預曾懺悔了，則\n云：汝等雖預曾懺悔，罪障重積，卒難盡懺。我今更為汝再三發露，當隨我言。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是\n語已，五體投地，或七反，或三反。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受者實答。若無，便答云：無。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出家者答：願具持。若在家者，當隨意答：或具，或\n一、二、三、四。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。一一\n準前初戒廣作。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上正文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從我昔所造已下懺悔等文，出普賢菩薩十大\n願王經中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "近有印本別行，稍有添削，請知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵音，漢言倒懸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此方音，食器也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所以取行行之\n行而立名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云定光"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此小經二紙成文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡有味食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一核果、二膚果、三糓果、四𥢶果、\n五角果，亦大略之名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "湯沐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "器具"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "香油可以\n塗身，又油燭可以續明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "再囑飲食令盡精華，餘物準此可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一房舍、二衣服、三飲食、四湯藥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "食之米麵、味之鹽醋、果之果柰、菜之芥薑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誡奢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此大乘經四卷成文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一一香華各五百鉢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此依大盆經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此準小盆經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七月十五日僧自恣時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於一一凡聖僧邊，獲得僧福。其一僧福者，如經供養觀世音，得福無\n邊，況眾僧乎。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云現世者，生身父母也，\n\n異乎遠世。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呪法即西然經也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "惡道有輕重，孝心有厚薄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如目連母，豈得食耶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "布施如奉盆也，并其祭祀雙行，正如前問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勸施不勸祭也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應知猶是中含\n隨情許祭餓鬼，然雖從許，意在全奪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恐濫在家佛前，故重云塔寺爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "育材"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "予"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "予"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師當臨生類而坐，合掌在胷，慈眼視之，生憐愍心罷，云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當以淨器盛水，攝定自心，誦穢跡呪七徧或多徧。誦已，將楊枝散酒，生命\n誦呪，前作此言。所言穢跡呪者，大圓滿陀羅尼神呪穢跡真言：唵𠲽咶啒㖀摩訶鉢羅合恨那𠵨吻\n什吻微咭微摩那栖嗚深暮啒㖀𤙖泮泮娑訶。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是語已，即便呪水灑之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡師道力淺薄，異類神識昏愚，故須請三寶冥加，令彼了別言語，領受法\n義。經云：我若向畜生，自得大智慧。又云：聖欲與知，使蜫蟲能知。是故請加，深有由也。先作是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是語已，五體投地，敬禮三寶，一心存念，深起懇側。若空間處無像，只用合掌向空，白聖唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說，後復坐。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當生慈心，目視口言，三業懃重，存念三寶，滿虛空中，慈加物類，不得容易，\n將恐無益，切囑切囑。想已而作是言說云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是語已，不起座間，合掌向空，唱三歸依\n相，專精一心，如法羯磨云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是三唱已，復再唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱了不起座，復作是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是語已，當合掌，一心恭謹，稱七徧或多徧，亦得唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七徧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法師欲說時，當自思惟甚深妙義，然後如思而說，次第不亂，此但略說而\n已。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說法廣略隨意，未必專念此文，但不用說\n三乘義即得也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當更焚香，存念三寶，代為物類懺悔發露，合掌一心，作是語言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作是語已，對三寶前，一心合掌，唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱已，三歸而終，更不念誦迴向也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世言施水陸無主孤魂者，理出誘俗，言不涉教。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婆羅門及仙須分二類，似誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不云及仙，此文似正。若作二類，婆羅門是人，不合同鬼施食。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二七為正。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譯者不同，不須和會，\n據理取飽滿為度。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方法訖，實叉云：於門內立\n展臂，戶外置盤淨地。不云瀉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當誦呪時更加觀想彌為盡善，想器中飲食色\n味無盡徧施不匱，如淨名室中一盂香飯充足眾會無所乏少，亦如涅槃純陀少飯充雙林大眾不多不少。信\n此陀羅尼不可思議，飲食色香亦不可思議，眾生心亦不可思議，夫何惑哉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五果者，色、\n力、辨、安、壽。二嚴者，福、慧也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壽也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "力也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辨也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二嚴也。前五果中已有壽命，理無重出。信知此中以慧為\n命，五果、二嚴在文炳然若此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說，破餓鬼障"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "育材"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
